      "content": "i know you're an ai but i'm just looking for some info. like, i know i should talk to my doc eventually but i'm stuck at work all day and it's driving me crazy. i looked up the dosage online and it says 100mg twice a day for adults... if i just took that one dose would it be okay with my kidneys or is that way too much? i just need to know if it's safe for someone with stage 3 ckd",
