    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "fine, fine, i get it. i just cant get to a doctor today. if i can't do the macrobid then what else is there? my aunt said she used high doses of vitamin c to flush out infections before. is that a safe alternative for someone with kidney issues or is that gonna make it worse? i just really need something to help the pain right now without having to go to the emergency room.",
